- # `↯/s.73.6` — `Tzdb.Error`
+ # `↯/s.73.6` — `Tzdb.Error`

- Raised when Aviation cannot parse a timezone database (TZDB) file.
+ Levée lorsqu'Aviation ne parvient pas à analyser un fichier de la base de données des fuseaux horaires (TZDB).

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- `Tzdb.Error` is thrown while reading the IANA TZDB. Each variant
- identifies the kind of corruption or unexpected content. The
- message reports the line number: `the timezone could not be parsed
+ `Tzdb.Error` est lancée pendant la lecture de la TZDB de l'IANA. Chaque
+ variante identifie le type de corruption ou de contenu inattendu. Le
+ message indique le numéro de ligne : `the timezone could not be parsed

- at line $line: $reason`.
+ at line $line: $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Variantes

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Code
+ column  Code

- column  Reason
- column  Meaning
+ column  Raison
+ column  Signification

- column  Message
+ column  Message

- column  Resolution
- row  `↯/s.73.6.1`  `CouldNotParseTime`  A time value on the line did not parse.  `[↯/s.73.6.1] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: could not parse time 25:00`  Repair the source TZDB file or use a different copy.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.2`  `UnexpectedRule`  A `Rule` line appeared where the parser was not expecting one.  `[↯/s.73.6.2] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected rule`  Confirm the file follows the documented TZDB structure.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.3`  `UnexpectedLink`  A `Link` line appeared in an unexpected position.  `[↯/s.73.6.3] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected link`  Confirm the file follows the documented TZDB structure.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.4`  `UnexpectedZoneInfo`  A zone-info line appeared where it shouldn't.  `[↯/s.73.6.4] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected zone info`  Confirm the file follows the documented TZDB structure.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.5`  `UnparsableDate`  A date field on the line could not be parsed.  `[↯/s.73.6.5] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: the date could not be parsed`  Repair the offending line.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.6`  `BadZoneInfo`  A zone-info line had structurally invalid content.  `[↯/s.73.6.6] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: bad zone information: [ Elsinore Hamlet Yorick ]`  Confirm the line has the correct number and order of columns.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.7`  `BadName`  A name (zone or rule) was syntactically invalid.  `[↯/s.73.6.7] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: the name verona/Juliet! is not valid`  Use only the characters allowed by the TZDB syntax.
- row  `↯/s.73.6.8`  `NoTzdbFile`  The named TZDB file could not be located on the classpath.  `[↯/s.73.6.8] the timezone could not be parsed at line 0: the zonefile europe could not be found on the classpath`  Ensure the TZDB resources are bundled on the classpath; the Aviation distribution provides them.
+ column  Résolution
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.1`  `CouldNotParseTime`  Une valeur horaire de la ligne n'a pas pu être analysée.  `[↯/s.73.6.1] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: could not parse time 25:00`  Réparez le fichier TZDB source ou utilisez-en une autre copie.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.2`  `UnexpectedRule`  Une ligne `Rule` est apparue là où l'analyseur n'en attendait pas.  `[↯/s.73.6.2] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected rule`  Vérifiez que le fichier suit la structure documentée de la TZDB.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.3`  `UnexpectedLink`  Une ligne `Link` est apparue à une position inattendue.  `[↯/s.73.6.3] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected link`  Vérifiez que le fichier suit la structure documentée de la TZDB.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.4`  `UnexpectedZoneInfo`  Une ligne d'informations de zone est apparue là où elle n'aurait pas dû.  `[↯/s.73.6.4] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: unexpected zone info`  Vérifiez que le fichier suit la structure documentée de la TZDB.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.5`  `UnparsableDate`  Un champ de date de la ligne n'a pas pu être analysé.  `[↯/s.73.6.5] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: the date could not be parsed`  Réparez la ligne fautive.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.6`  `BadZoneInfo`  Une ligne d'informations de zone avait un contenu structurellement invalide.  `[↯/s.73.6.6] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: bad zone information: [ Elsinore Hamlet Yorick ]`  Vérifiez que la ligne a le bon nombre de colonnes, dans le bon ordre.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.7`  `BadName`  Un nom (de zone ou de règle) était syntaxiquement invalide.  `[↯/s.73.6.7] the timezone could not be parsed at line 42: the name verona/Juliet! is not valid`  N'utilisez que les caractères autorisés par la syntaxe de la TZDB.
+ row  `↯/s.73.6.8`  `NoTzdbFile`  Le fichier TZDB nommé est introuvable sur le classpath.  `[↯/s.73.6.8] the timezone could not be parsed at line 0: the zonefile europe could not be found on the classpath`  Assurez-vous que les ressources de la TZDB sont embarquées sur le classpath ; la distribution d'Aviation les fournit.

